==== Physically breaking into the DIR-825 ====
**Note:** This may void your warranty!

To remove the cover simply:
  - Remove the two (2) back rubber feet. (closest to the ethernet ports and antennas)
  - Unscrew the two (2) screws underneath the feet.
  - Pry case halves apart from back side to front side, carefully.
 
To remove the board from the casing:
  - Unscrew the two (2) front (inner) screws and remove the LED shield.
  - Lift board from front and slide out in a forward motion.

